 libgl1-mesa-dri (= ${source:Version}),
 mesa-vulkan-drivers (= ${source:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: Aurora Mesa for Flatpak apps
 Flatpak apps load OpenGL and Vulkan from the runtime's GL extension, not
 from the system, so without this they run Flathub's GL.default Mesa. This
 package carries org.freedesktop.Platform.GL.aurora, Aurora's Mesa built for
 the Freedesktop 25.08 and 26.08 runtimes from the same commit as the
 system's Mesa, as a local OSTree repository; it installs it into the system
 Flatpak installation and enables it for every Flatpak app ahead of
 GL.default. Runtime branches without a GL.aurora build keep GL.default.
 .
 Removing the package removes the extension and the settings.
